# With completed hidden, completing a Today entry removes it, and z brings it back with its focus.
file <<END
- First @due({today})
- Second @due({today})
- Third @due({today})
END
keys gc gt
see Today
keys j x
hide Second
see ▌ - Third
keys z
see ▌ - Second
quit
saved <<END
- First @due({today})
- Second @due({today})
- Third @due({today})
END
